a name not there: written true, holds the text true, beside it 1
a file with its own mode: written true, holds the text true, mode kept true, beside it 1
a file with two names: written true, both hold the text true, still two names true
a directory that takes no new name: written true, holds the text true
the null device: written true, still a device true
a directory: written false, still a directory true
a name in a directory not there: written false, nothing made true
